e in a fix-type fixture), the PowerShell forms, the relative-path and `cd` cases, the fail-closed cases, the negative list of item 8, the wiring test, the `ci_settings_file` test, the two eval cases validated by `--dry-run`, and the `Framework evals` run on the build branch as the live proof of both cases.",
